---
import BusinessPage from "../../components/business/BusinessPage.astro";
---

<BusinessPage
  title="普莱 AI 工作室"
  description="从一句想法开始，和普莱试试音乐与造型。体验示例报价、作品和本标签页的积分流水。"
>
  <section class="studio-stage">
    <div class="biz-wrap studio-grid">
      <div class="intro">
        <p class="biz-overline">普莱 AI 工作室 · 交互演示</p><h1
          class="biz-title"
        >
          让你的心情，<br />有自己的作品。
        </h1>
        <p class="biz-lead">
          从一句想法开始，和普莱试试音乐与造型。这里展示创作流程，尚未接入生成模型。
        </p>
        <figure>
          <img
            src="/assets/business/studio-music.webp"
            width="490"
            height="426"
            alt="戴着蓝色耳机的普莱站在唱片上"
          /><figcaption>你的灵感，正在找到频率。</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <a href="#studio-account"
          >示例余额 <b data-balance>40</b> NC · 查看流水 ↓</a>
      </div>
      <div class="biz-panel console">
        <div class="biz-row">
          <small>本地创作体验</small><span class="badge">未接 AI 模型</span>
        </div>
        <div class="scene" aria-label="创作场景">
          <button type="button" data-scene="music" aria-pressed="true"
            >♫ 心情音乐</button
          ><button type="button" data-scene="fashion" aria-pressed="false"
            >✦ 普莱造型</button>
        </div>
        <label for="prompt"><b data-prompt-label>这次想表达什么？</b></label
        ><textarea id="prompt" rows="2" maxlength="240"
          >给今天的小小胜利，配一首轻快的歌</textarea
        >
        <div class="biz-row price">
          <span data-route>输入心情 → 示例报价 → 确认 → 预制片段</span><strong
            data-price>8 示例NC</strong>
        </div>
        <p class="biz-note">
          场景消耗仅为演示，不是正式价格。不会生成真实 AI
          内容，也不会操作真实账户。
        </p>
        <div class="status" aria-live="polite" data-status>
          写下想法，先看报价，再决定。
        </div>
        <div class="buttons">
          <button type="button" data-main class="biz-btn">查看示例报价</button
          ><button type="button" data-cancel class="biz-btn light" hidden
            >取消</button
          ><button type="button" data-play class="biz-btn light" hidden
            >试听示例片段</button>
        </div>
        <details>
          <summary>体验其他状态</summary><div class="test-states">
            <button data-test="insufficient">余额不足</button><button
              data-test="failure">生成失败</button
            ><button data-test="timeout">等待超时</button>
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="ledger" id="studio-account">
    <div class="biz-wrap studio-grid">
      <div class="ledger-intro">
        <h2 class="biz-heading">先说清楚，<br />再一起创造。</h2><p
          class="biz-lead"
        >
          本地示例音乐与造型仅供体验流程。正式模型能力、版权范围、审核要求与计费规则需在上线前明确。
        </p><a class="biz-btn light" href="/newcoin/"
          >走进 NewCoin 用途展台 ↗</a>
      </div>
      <div class="account">
        <small>本标签页 · 示例积分账户</small><div class="biz-row">
          <div><strong data-balance>40</strong> 示例NC</div><img
            src="/assets/business/coin.svg"
            width="64"
            height="64"
            alt=""
          />
        </div>
        <div class="biz-row">
          <small>预占 <b data-reserved>0</b> 示例NC</small><small
            >仅此标签页保存</small>
        </div>
        <p class="biz-note">
          与 NewCoin Token 分开。本演示没有 Token
          资产、兑换或提现功能。关闭标签页后结束示例会话。
        </p>
        <div class="entries">
          <span>示例流水</span><ul data-entries>
            <li>初始演示额度：40 示例NC</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BusinessPage>
<style>
  .studio-stage {
    background: #10234b;
    padding: 70px 0 80px;
  }
  .studio-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1.15fr);
    gap: clamp(40px, 9vw, 160px);
    align-items: start;
  }
  .intro {
    color: white;
  }
  .intro h1 {
    margin: 19px 0 26px;
  }
  .intro > .biz-lead {
    color: #c1d7ed;
  }
  .intro figure {
    position: relative;
    margin: 54px 0 20px;
  }
  .intro img {
    width: min(100%, 490px);
    aspect-ratio: 490/426;
    height: auto;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 28px;
  }
  .intro figcaption {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 15px;
    left: 20px;
    padding: 8px 14px;
    border-radius: 30px;
    background: #10234be8;
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  .intro > a {
    color: #dae8ff;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .console {
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .console .badge {
    border: 1px solid;
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 5px 12px;
    font-size: 11px;
  }
  .scene {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 6px;
    background: #edf2f9;
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 5px;
    margin: 27px 0 22px;
  }
  .scene button {
    border: 0;
    background: none;
    color: #526783;
    padding: 13px 5px;
    border-radius: 10px;
  }
  .scene button[aria-pressed="true"] {
    color: white;
    background: #12234c;
  }
  .console textarea {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background: #f9fcff;
    border: 1px solid #9eb5ce;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 11px 13px;
    margin: 8px 0 18px;
    resize: vertical;
    font-size: 16px;
  }
  .price {
    font-size: 11px;
  }
  .price strong {
    font-size: 20px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .console .biz-note {
    margin: 20px 0;
  }
  .status {
    background: #edf4fc;
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 16px;
    min-height: 80px;
    white-space: pre-line;
  }
  .status img {
    max-height: 140px;
    object-fit: contain;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }
  .buttons,
  .test-states {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin: 24px 0;
  }
  .console details {
    margin: 30px 0 8px;
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  .console summary {
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .test-states button {
    border: 1px solid #b5c9e0;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: #edf4fc;
    padding: 8px;
  }
  .ledger {
    background: #eaf1fc;
    padding: 72px 0;
  }
  .ledger-intro p {
    margin: 28px 0;
  }
  .account {
    border-block: 1px solid #aebfd6;
    padding: 20px 0 10px;
  }
  .account strong {
    font:
      700 54px/1.7 "NewPlay Space",
      sans-serif;
  }
  .account .biz-note {
    margin: 16px 0;
  }
  .entries {
    border-top: 1px solid #bccde1;
    padding: 16px 0;
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .entries ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 8px 0 0;
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  @media (min-width: 1250px) {
    .studio-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 510px minmax(0, 590px);
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 40px;
    }
    .studio-stage {
      min-height: 962.5px;
      padding-bottom: 62px;
    }
    .intro figure {
      margin-top: 42px;
    }
    .ledger {
      min-height: 466px;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .studio-grid {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 28px;
    }
    .studio-stage,
    .ledger {
      padding: 40px 0;
    }
    .intro h1 {
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    .intro figure {
      margin: 44px 0 21px;
    }
    .intro img {
      width: 100%;
    }
    .console {
      min-height: 649px;
    }
    .price {
      align-items: start;
    }
    .price strong {
      font-size: 17px;
    }
    .ledger-intro p {
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    .account strong {
      font-size: 46px;
    }
  }
</style>
<script src="../../components/business/studio.ts"></script>
